Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:37:46 -0300
Subject: FreeBSD ports www/qt6-webengine patches (freebsd-ports fbb8b4880d68,
 Qt 6.10.2), applied to 6.10.3

1034 of 1037 apply as is. partition_alloc_constants.h ported by hand
(the arm64 hunk is left out: not our target); security-rollup left out
(6.10.3 carries those fixes).
